{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_22431","headline":"感秋怀微之 · 白居易","name":"感秋怀微之","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"叶下湖又波，秋风此时至。\n谁知濩落心，先纳萧条气。\n推移感流岁，漂泊思同志。\n昔爲烟霄侣，今作泥涂吏。\n白鸥毛羽弱，青凤文章异。\n各闭一笼中，岁晚同顦顇。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_22431.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_22431","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}